# every N that hits the surface is captured with probability 0.4
#
# R is recombination in surf_react prob terms: one reactant, no product, so
# the molecule is removed from the gas and its mass is retained by the
# surface.  That is a sticking coefficient by another name, and it is what
# compute react/isurf/grid ... mass reports as a mass flow.

N --> NULL
R S 0.4 0.0
